# The rules of the coop story on a -mp2 instance (the second multiplayer design; src/game/App/NetScene.c reads
# SceneSkip). One rule a line: its name, a space, its value. A line that starts with # is a comment.
#
# SceneSkip: who ends a scene for every member with Escape.
#   all   every member who sees the scene asked (the default)
#   any   the first member who asks
#   host  player 0 alone
#   none  nobody, the scene plays to its end
SceneSkip all
